Test vectors for the Brotli decoder.

Files named <name> and <name>.compressed[.NN] are from the reference
implementation, https://github.com/google/brotli, directory tests/testdata,
at commit fbadc67bfce560b92e922f5645cc95bbffe38420 (MIT license,
Copyright (c) 2009, 2010, 2013-2016 by the Brotli Authors). Originals that
are large and repetitive are not copied; the tests build them:

  zeros               262144 zero bytes
  zerosukkanooa       zeros followed by ukkonooa
  quickfox_repeated   quickfox repeated 4096 times
  backward65536       256 zero bytes, 65280 bytes "X", 256 zero bytes

These three were made with the brotli command line tool 1.2.1 to cover
window sizes the reference vectors do not:

  asyoulik.txt.w10.compressed       brotli -q 11 -w 10 asyoulik.txt
  quickfox_repeated.w10.compressed  brotli -q 11 -w 10 quickfox_repeated
  monkey.w24.compressed             brotli -q 11 -w 24 monkey
